ially of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/human\" title=\"human\">humans</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/animal\" title=\"animal\">animals</a>"},{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/penis\" title=\"penis\">penis</a>, the male <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/erectile\" title=\"erectile\">erectile</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/reproductive\" title=\"reproductive\">reproductive</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/organ\" title=\"organ\">organ</a> used for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sexual_intercourse\" title=\"sexual intercourse\">sexual intercourse</a> and for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/urination\" title=\"urination\">urination</a>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Ottoman Turkish","definitions":[{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/remembrance\" title=\"remembrance\">remembrance</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/recollection\" title=\"recollection\">recollection</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/reminiscence\" title=\"reminiscence\">reminiscence</a>, the act of remembering or holding in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mind\" title=\"mind\">mind</a>"},{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mention\" title=\"mention\">mention</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/citation\" title=\"citation\">citation</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/quote\" title=\"quote\">quote</a>, a speaking or noticing of anything, usually in a brief <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/manner\" title=\"manner\">manner</a>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt127\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dhikr\" title=\"dhikr\">dhikr</a>, a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/prayer\" title=\"prayer\">prayer</a> whereby a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/phrase\" title=\"phrase\">phrase</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/expression\" title=\"expression\">expression</a> is repeated continually"}]},{"partOfSpee